(text "W65C816S (65C816 in DIP-40).\nD0-D7 carry the bank byte while PHI2 is low;\nU2 captures it while LE is high (see NOTE 6 of decode.pld).\n~{ABORT}, BE, RDY and ~{NMI} are tied to +5V.\nVDA, VPA, ~{VP}, ~{ML}, E and MX are not connected." (at 50.8 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 62b04eaa-dc96-5f5f-a31e-58022ef94d61))
