(text "U3 runs pld/decode.pld (816DEC02):\n  PHI2.R    = /PHI2                    (CLK2 / 2)\n  LE        = /PHI2 * /CLK2\n  /ROMCE    = /A23*/A18*/A17*/A16*A15\n  /RAMCE    = bank 0 $0000-$5FFF, or /A23 * (A16+A17+A18)\n  /VRAMCE   = A23\n  /IOSEL    = /A23*/A18*/A17*/A16*/A15*A14*A13\n  /OEGATE   = PHI2 * RWB\n  /WEGATE   = PHI2 * /RWB\n~{VRAMCE} (pin 17) is not connected: video RAM is future expansion.\nA12 is wired but unused (NOTE 4).  Pins 11, 13, 15, 16 spare.\nBurn with power-down disabled (NOTE 5)." (at 175.26 200.66 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 147d905c-c4b4-5ee0-bd9f-0ad5d26f41c6))
